1230</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">altogether, absolutely</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">503a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ π. ᾔσθησαι</span> not <b class=\"lex-tr\">at all</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prm.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">128b</span> </span>.</div></div>"}